{"id":2338,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><div><p>近日，第六届全国高校教师教学创新大赛山西赛区比赛结果揭晓。我院机械电子工程专业教师团队：王禹、赵鹏飞、李建素、陈雪丽负责的课程《嵌入式计算机原理与接口技术课程设计》荣获实验教学赛道一等奖，并成功获得国赛推荐资格。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MzNVsMlW7nzrko2zGZLNU8Mlrkozvd4LmGaoRM2UmW7UN-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4LYyZnkhRnRGZLllPUNlZMRCZU49ZnzG4nRf2nz7aUmWFU4Q7nllYnzVFLlV2M7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0338DCD081E1BE8468C88E03D0FE10B2/C6DEE2E1/1AF4F\" vheight=\"331\" vwidth=\"441\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MzNVsMlW7nzrko2zGZLNU8Mlrkozvd4LmGaoRM2UmW7UN-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4LYyZnkhRnRGZLllPUNlZMRCZU49ZnzG4nRf2nz7aUmWFU4Q7nllYnzVFLlV2M7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\"></p><p>课程围绕《嵌入式计算机原理与接口技术课程设计》教学痛点，系统展示了以纵向迁移、自主演化、创新驱动为核心的三层联动实验教学模型；通过典型“做中学”完整教学案例，呈现了课程在内容重构、教学实施、评价反馈三个维度的系统性创新设计。课程聚焦学生工程实践与创新能力培养，在培养学生自主探究、实践能力、科研创新方面取得显著成效。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MlLVPU4A7nzNYL28WVU87PMRnfUmCdYMmvbn7C8UmvDL470gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRM1h2UYyZUzTfUm9bU4M2nNnRL4CPnNUiMRCDMNrfU46FL4G8MzGZUlnFLNnfLRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2C6FC8A9AB89C3FFDC361FD54666EAC7/304508AD/2DA06\" vheight=\"281\" vwidth=\"446\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MlLVPU4A7nzNYL28WVU87PMRnfUmCdYMmvbn7C8UmvDL470gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRM1h2UYyZUzTfUm9bU4M2nNnRL4CPnNUiMRCDMNrfU46FL4G8MzGZUlnFLNnfLRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7U47Vinz6VMRUPU2zL8o7Cbo7QkolrdkL8MRoR7iMmTkL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZUYh2oShkM8VRMmvDUN-PM4NYMR9aUzr2nRMVLzN4nlQFU4W2L4UsnR6FL4UPU8LJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/58CF9B7AC676BB1792480A5FD3E193EF/C2F347D7/341CC\" vheight=\"196\" vwidth=\"466\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7UNnVfMm-aU4-DM2RTfL4CPo7CDMmNdbnlL8L8UaLmNYo770gihFp2hmCIa0oSy4LYyPn1h2nRM7LzM7LmlDUm-ZU4-PU49YM47bL4VVL8WFozQRL87aMRnFnzT7M87Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\"></p><p>此次获奖充分展示了我院教师在课程改革与实验教学方面的扎实功底。学院将以此为契机，持续推动教学创新，力争在国赛中再创佳绩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7Uz-VsnN7sn7V2o27LZnR9aLmUZLzLdDLlnVolWRMlM2M770gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRnkh2L1hknR9ZUzCiLNUZMzUZUzM2nNCiMl-YUlWkUzTFnm6VUlr2nNMFLmGiLm-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6CDF2BD88A652D8548A3FFF55B2ABBA9/F7EAEFFC/20522\" vheight=\"292\" vwidth=\"566\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7Uz-VsnN7sn7V2o27LZnR9aLmUZLzLdDLlnVolWRMlM2M770gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRnkh2L1hknR9ZUzCiLNUZMzUZUzM2nNCiMl-YUlWkUzTFnm6VUlr2nNMFLmGiLm-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7LzfVVoRM2Ul7sU2mGaU87bMRCDUlUdYM4G8nzviMRvaU4C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfUShVMkybU8nfM778Mzv8nNMknl-anlC8U8lDM4NbMRQFU8W2ollsMmVFLmCYLzGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DAAE49CDA4A4574FCBEB0EF4CE679946/CBF9E761/26210\" vheight=\"313\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7LzfVVoRM2Ul7sU2mGaU87bMRCDUlUdYM4G8nzviMRvaU4C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfUShVMkybU8nfM778Mzv8nNMknl-anlC8U8lDM4NbMRQFU8W2ollsMmVFLmCYLzGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png\"></p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MzNVsMlW7nzrko2zGZLNU8Mlrkozvd4LmGaoRM2UmW7UN-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4LYyZnkhRnRGZLllPUNlZMRCZU49ZnzG4nRf2nz7aUmWFU4Q7nllYnzVFLlV2M7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LiMmlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35657&e=.png"}